function travelOverview(s){const rr=rows(s),colors=['#6e6e6e','#888888','#787878','#7f7f7f','#858585','#a3a3a3'];return `<section class="panel travel-overview" aria-label="해외 바이어 단계별 방한 현황"><div class="travel-overview-head"><h2>해외 바이어 방한 현황</h2><span>전체 ${rr.length}명 · 현재 행사 · 예시 데이터</span></div><div class="travel-stage-grid">${travelStages.map((stage,i)=>{const count=rr.filter(r=>r[4]===stage).length;return `<button type="button" class="travel-stage ${filter.f3===stage?'active':''}" data-action="travel-stage" data-stage="${E(stage)}" aria-pressed="${filter.f3===stage}" style="--stage-color:${colors[i]}"><span class="travel-stage-name"><i data-lucide="${['plane-landing','bus','hotel','map-pin','users','messages-square'][i]}" aria-hidden="true"></i>${E(stage)}</span><strong>${count}<small>명</small></strong><span class="travel-stage-caption">현재 단계</span></button>`}).join('')}</div><div class="travel-updated"><span>Last updated: <time datetime="${travelUpdated.toISOString()}">${E(travelUpdated.toLocaleString('ko-KR',{hour12:false}))}</time></span>${B('travel-refresh','새로고침','btn ghost')}</div></section>`}
const travelList=list;
list=function(s){if(s.id!=='PRE-01')return travelList(s);return `${head(s,actionButtons(s))}${filters(s)}${travelOverview(s)}<section class="panel"><div class="panelhead"><h2>조회 결과</h2><span>현재 행사 · 예시</span></div>${table(s,filtered(s))}</section>`};
const travelField=field;
field=function(s,label,desc,i){if(s.id==='PRE-02'&&i===4)return F('이동상태',`<select name="field4">${O(travelStages,forms[s.id]?.field4||rows(map.get('PRE-01'))[selectedRow]?.[4]||travelStages[0])}</select>`);return travelField(s,label,desc,i)};
const travelGeneric=genericAction;
genericAction=function(label){if(current==='PRE-02'&&label==='상태 변경'){const f=document.getElementById('generic-form');if(!f.reportValidity())return;const rr=rows(map.get('PRE-01')),stage=f.elements.field4.value;if(!rr[selectedRow]||!travelStages.includes(stage))return toast('대상과 이동상태를 확인해 주세요.');rr[selectedRow][4]=stage;lists['PRE-01']=rr;forms['PRE-02']=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f));travelUpdated=new Date();log('이동상태 변경',rr[selectedRow][0]+' · '+stage);nav('PRE-01');toast('예시 이동상태와 단계별 현황을 갱신했습니다.');return}travelGeneric(label)};
root.addEventListener('click',ev=>{const b=ev.target.closest('[data-action]');if(!b||current!=='PRE-01')return;if(b.dataset.action==='travel-stage'){filter.f3=filter.f3===b.dataset.stage?'전체':b.dataset.stage;render()}else if(b.dataset.action==='travel-refresh'){travelUpdated=new Date();render();toast('현재 예시 방한 현황을 새로고침했습니다.')}});
function matchingChips(selected){return selected.map(v=>`<button type="button" class="matching-chip" data-action="matching-remove" data-value="${E(v)}" aria-label="${E(v)} 선택 해제">${E(v)}<span aria-hidden="true">⊗</span></button>`).join('')}
function matchingMulti(label,key,options){const selected=Array.isArray(filter[key])?filter[key]:[];return `<div class="field"><span>${E(label)}</span><details class="matching-multi" data-multi-filter><summary aria-label="${E(label)} 복수 선택">${E(label)}${selected.length?' ('+selected.length+')':''}<span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></summary><div class="matching-options" role="group" aria-label="${E(label)}"><input type="search" class="matching-search" placeholder="내용을 입력해주세요" aria-label="${E(label)} 항목 검색"><div class="matching-chips" aria-live="polite">${matchingChips(selected)}</div><div class="matching-option-grid">${options.map(v=>`<label data-option="${E(v)}"><input type="checkbox" name="${key}" value="${E(v)}" ${selected.includes(v)?'checked':''}><span>${E(v)}</span></label>`).join('')}</div><p class="matching-no-results" hidden>검색 결과가 없습니다.</p></div></details></div>`}
const matchingFilters=filters;
filters=function(s){if(s.id!=='PRE-04')return matchingFilters(s);const rr=rows(s),buyers=[...new Set([...rows(map.get('BAS-03')).map(r=>r[1]),...rr.map(r=>r[0])])],interpreters=[...new Set([...rows(map.get('BAS-07')).map(r=>r[1]),...rr.map(r=>r[2])])].filter(v=>v!=='미지정'),languages=[...new Set(rr.map(r=>r[3]))];return `<form id="filter-form" class="panel filters matching-filters">${F('행사',`<select name="f0">${O(filterOpts('행사'),filter.f0||'전체')}</select>`)}${matchingMulti('해외 바이어','f1',buyers)}${matchingMulti('통역원','f2',interpreters)}${matchingMulti('통역원 언어','f3',languages)}${F('매칭 여부',`<select name="f4">${O(['전체','매칭','미매칭'],filter.f4||'전체')}</select>`)}<div class="row"><button type="submit" class="btn primary">검색</button>${B('reset','초기화')}</div></form>`};
const matchingFiltered=filtered;
filtered=function(s){if(s.id!=='PRE-04')return matchingFiltered(s);const chosen=key=>Array.isArray(filter[key])?filter[key]:filter[key]?[filter[key]]:[];return rows(s).map((r,i)=>({r,i})).filter(({r})=>(!chosen('f1').length||chosen('f1').includes(r[0]))&&(!chosen('f2').length||chosen('f2').includes(r[2]))&&(!chosen('f3').length||chosen('f3').includes(r[3]))&&(!filter.f4||filter.f4==='전체'||(filter.f4==='미매칭'?r[2]==='미지정':r[2]!=='미지정')))};
function updateMatchingMulti(multi){const selected=[...multi.querySelectorAll('input[type=checkbox]:checked')].map(e=>e.value);multi.querySelector('.matching-chips').innerHTML=matchingChips(selected);const summary=multi.querySelector('summary'),label=summary.getAttribute('aria-label').replace(' 복수 선택','');summary.innerHTML=`${E(label)}${selected.length?' ('+selected.length+')':''}<span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span>`}
root.addEventListener('change',ev=>{const multi=ev.target.closest('[data-multi-filter]');if(multi&&ev.target.type==='checkbox')updateMatchingMulti(multi)});
root.addEventListener('input',ev=>{if(!ev.target.matches('.matching-search'))return;const multi=ev.target.closest('[data-multi-filter]'),query=ev.target.value.trim().toLocaleLowerCase();multi.querySelectorAll('[data-option]').forEach(e=>e.hidden=!e.dataset.option.toLocaleLowerCase().includes(query));multi.querySelector('.matching-no-results').hidden=[...multi.querySelectorAll('[data-option]')].some(e=>!e.hidden)});
root.addEventListener('click',ev=>{const remove=ev.target.closest('[data-action=matching-remove]');if(remove){ev.stopPropagation();const multi=remove.closest('[data-multi-filter]'),input=[...multi.querySelectorAll('input[type=checkbox]')].find(e=>e.value===remove.dataset.value);if(input){input.checked=false;updateMatchingMulti(multi);multi.querySelector('.matching-search').focus()}}const summary=ev.target.closest('[data-multi-filter] summary');if(summary)root.querySelectorAll('[data-multi-filter][open]').forEach(e=>{if(e!==summary.parentElement)e.open=false})});
document.addEventListener('click',ev=>{root.querySelectorAll('[data-multi-filter][open]').forEach(e=>{if(!e.contains(ev.target))e.open=false})});
root.addEventListener('keydown',ev=>{if(ev.key==='Escape'){const multi=ev.target.closest('[data-multi-filter]');if(multi){multi.open=false;multi.querySelector('summary').focus()}}});
const exportJournalRows=jRows;
jRows=function(s){const rr=exportJournalRows(s),buyers=Array.isArray(filter.exportBuyers)?filter.exportBuyers:[],interpreters=Array.isArray(filter.exportInterpreters)?filter.exportInterpreters:[];return rr.filter(j=>(!buyers.length||buyers.includes(j.buyer))&&(!interpreters.length||interpreters.includes(j.writer)))};
const exportJournalList=journalList;
journalList=function(s){const html=exportJournalList(s);if(s.id!=='JNL-EXP')return html;const exportRows=journals.filter(j=>j.type==='수출'),buyers=[...new Set(exportRows.map(j=>j.buyer))],interpreters=[...new Set(exportRows.map(j=>j.writer))];const controls=`<form id="journal-filter" class="panel filters matching-filters">${F('상담 유형',`<select name="type">${O(['수출'],'수출')}</select>`)}${F('처리 상태',`<select name="status">${O(['전체','검수 대기','승인 완료','반려','임시저장'],filter.status||'전체')}</select>`)}${matchingMulti('해외 바이어','exportBuyers',buyers)}${matchingMulti('통역원','exportInterpreters',interpreters)}<div class="row"><button type="submit" class="btn primary">검색</button>${B('reset','초기화')}</div></form>`;return html.replace(/<form id="journal-filter"[\s\S]*?<\/form>/,controls)};
const buyJournalRows=jRows;
jRows=function(s){const rr=buyJournalRows(s),buyers=Array.isArray(filter.domesticBuyers)?filter.domesticBuyers:[],company=(filter.buyCompany||'').trim();return rr.filter(j=>(!company||j.company.includes(company))&&(!buyers.length||buyers.includes(j.buyer)))};
const buyJournalList=journalList;
journalList=function(s){const html=buyJournalList(s);if(s.id!=='JNL-BUY')return html;const buyers=[...new Set(journals.filter(j=>j.type==='구매').map(j=>j.buyer))];const controls=`<form id="journal-filter" class="panel filters matching-filters">${F('상담 유형',`<select name="type">${O(['구매'],'구매')}</select>`)}${F('처리 상태',`<select name="status">${O(['전체','검수 대기','승인 완료','반려','임시저장'],filter.status||'전체')}</select>`)}${F('기업명',I('buyCompany','search',filter.buyCompany||'','placeholder="기업명 입력"'))}${matchingMulti('국내 바이어','domesticBuyers',buyers)}<div class="row"><button type="submit" class="btn primary">검색</button>${B('reset','초기화')}</div></form>`;return html.replace(/<form id="journal-filter"[\s\S]*?<\/form>/,controls)};
let statisticsCategory='리빙';
function statisticsData(){const buy=kind!=='수출',exp=kind!=='구매',b=dashboardExample.buy,e=dashboardExample.export;return {buy,exp,count:(buy?b.count:0)+(exp?e.count:0),contracts:(buy?b.contracts:0)+(exp?e.contracts:0),attendance:[(buy?6:0)+(exp?12:0),(buy?42:0)+(exp?96:0)],companies:buy&&exp?[84,16]:buy?[42,8]:[64,12],buyers:[(buy?42:0)+(exp?96:0),(buy?6:0)+(exp?12:0)],money:buy&&exp?'3.2억원 / 1.8백만 USD':buy?'3.2억원':'1.8백만 USD',contractMoney:buy&&exp?'0.9억원 / 0.6백만 USD':buy?'0.9억원':'0.6백만 USD'}}
function statisticsRanks(group){const exportOnly=group==='해외 바이어'||kind==='수출',currency=exportOnly?'USD':'KRW',counts=group==='국내 바이어'?[48,40,32,28,20]:group==='해외 바이어'?[90,75,62,51,40]:group==='참가기업'?(kind==='전체'?[130,110,100,80,66]:kind==='구매'?[48,40,32,28,20]:[90,75,62,51,40]):[42,36,30,24,18];const names=group==='품목별'?{리빙:['주방용품','생활용품','인테리어','가구','청소용품'],뷰티:['스킨케어','색조 화장품','미용기기','헤어케어','네일용품'],식품:['가공식품','음료','건강식품','간편식','과자'],기타:['산업용품','전자기기','스포츠용품','문구','기타제품']}[statisticsCategory]:counts.map((_,i)=>'예시 '+group+' '+String.fromCharCode(65+i));return names.map((name,i)=>({name,count:counts[i],amount:counts[i]*(currency==='USD'?2000:1000000),currency,exportAmount:kind==='전체'&&group==='참가기업'?counts[i]*2000:null}))}
function statisticsRankSection(group,color){const rr=statisticsRanks(group),max=Math.max(...rr.map(r=>r.count));return `<section class="statistics-ranking"><div class="statistics-section-title"><h2><i></i>${E(group)} TOP5</h2>${group==='품목별'?`<label class="statistics-category"><span class="small">품목 분류</span><select id="statistics-category" aria-label="품목 분류">${O(['리빙','뷰티','식품','기타'],statisticsCategory)}</select></label>`:''}${A(group==='품목별'?'STA-04':'STA-03','상세 보기','btn ghost')}</div><div class="statistics-rank-body"><div><div class="statistics-chart-title"><h3>누적 상담 건수</h3><small>단위: 건</small></div><div class="statistics-horizontal">${rr.map(r=>`<div><span>${E(r.name)}</span><b>${r.count}건</b><div class="statistics-track"><span style="width:${r.count/max*100}%;background:${color}"></span></div></div>`).join('')}</div></div><div><div class="statistics-chart-title"><h3>누적 상담 금액</h3><small>원통화 기준</small></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>NO</th><th>${E(group)}</th><th>금액</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rr.map((r,i)=>`<tr><td>${i+1}</td><td>${E(r.name)}</td><td>${r.amount.toLocaleString()} ${r.currency}${r.exportAmount?`<small>${r.exportAmount.toLocaleString()} USD</small>`:''}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div></div></div></section>`}
function statisticsJournal(type){const d=dashboardExample[type==='구매'?'buy':'export'];return `<div class="statistics-journal"><h3>${type}상담일지</h3><div class="overview-status"><div class="overview-donut" style="background:conic-gradient(#949494 0 ${d.status[0]/d.count*100}%,#bebebe ${d.status[0]/d.count*100}% ${(d.status[0]+d.status[1])/d.count*100}%,#919191 0)" role="img" aria-label="${type} 승인 ${d.status[0]}건, 대기 ${d.status[1]}건, 반려 ${d.status[2]}건"><span>${type}<small>${d.count}건</small></span></div><ul class="overview-legend status-legend">${['승인','대기','반려'].map((t,i)=>`<li><i style="background:${['#949494','#bebebe','#919191'][i]}"></i><span>${t}</span><b>${d.status[i]}건</b></li>`).join('')}</ul></div></div>`}
const statisticsDashboard=dash;
dash=function(s){if(s.id!=='STA-01')return statisticsDashboard(s);const d=statisticsData(),progress=kind==='구매'?[20,16,14,10]:kind==='수출'?[30,24,22,18]:[50,40,36,28];return `${head({...s,title:'통계 대시보드'},B('xlsx','엑셀 다운로드','btn primary'))}<div class="toolbar statistics-toolbar"><div class="tabs">${['전체','구매','수출'].map(k=>B('kind',k,'btn '+(kind===k?'primary':''),`data-kind="${k}" aria-pressed="${kind===k}"`)).join('')}</div><span class="small">${E(event)} G-FAIR · ${kind==='전체'?'구매 + 수출':kind} 누적 통계 · 예시 데이터</span></div><div class="statistics-top"><article class="statistics-card"><h3>바이어 수 및 출결</h3><strong class="statistics-number">${d.attendance.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)}<small>명</small></strong>${dashboardStack(['미출석','출석'],d.attendance,['#919191','#a9a9a9'])}</article><article class="statistics-card"><div class="statistics-chart-title"><h3>누적 계약 추진 현황</h3><small>단위: 건</small></div><div class="statistics-progress" role="img" aria-label="검토중 ${progress[0]}건, 샘플/견적 협의 ${progress[1]}건, 계약 협의 ${progress[2]}건, 계약 체결 ${progress[3]}건">${['검토중','샘플·견적 협의','계약 협의','계약 체결'].map((t,i)=>`<div><span style="height:${progress[i]/Math.max(...progress)*100}px"></span><small>${t}</small><b>${progress[i]}</b></div>`).join('')}</div></article><div class="statistics-summary">${[['누적 상담 건수',d.count,'건','clipboard-list','#a9a9a9'],['누적 계약 추진 건수',d.contracts,'건','pen-line','#b8b8b8'],['누적 상담액',d.money,'','hand-coins','#949494'],['계약 추진 중인 금액',d.contractMoney,'','wallet','#9a9a9a']].map(([t,v,u,icon,color])=>`<article class="statistics-card statistics-metric"><span class="statistics-icon" style="background:${color}"><i data-lucide="${icon}" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><h3>${t}</h3><strong class="${typeof v==='string'?'statistics-money':'statistics-number'}">${E(v)}<small>${u}</small></strong></div></article>`).join('')}</div><article class="statistics-card"><h3>참여 기업</h3><div class="statistics-participation">${[['참여',d.companies[0],'building-2'],['불참',d.companies[1],'building-2']].map(([t,v,icon],i)=>`<div class="${i?'inactive':''}"><i data-lucide="${icon}" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>${t}</span><strong>${v}<small>개사</small></strong></div>`).join('')}</div></article><article class="statistics-card"><h3>참여 바이어</h3><div class="statistics-participation">${[['참여',d.buyers[0]],['불참',d.buyers[1]]].map(([t,v],i)=>`<div class="${i?'inactive':''}"><i data-lucide="users" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>${t}</span><strong>${v}<small>명</small></strong></div>`).join('')}</div></article><article class="statistics-card statistics-journals">${d.buy?statisticsJournal('구매'):''}${d.exp?statisticsJournal('수출'):''}</article></div>${d.buy?statisticsRankSection('국내 바이어','#919191'):''}${d.exp?statisticsRankSection('해외 바이어','#a9a9a9'):''}${statisticsRankSection('참가기업','#949494')}${statisticsRankSection('품목별','#b8b8b8')}<p class="small statistics-footnote">예시 통계 · KRW와 USD는 환산 없이 구분 표시됩니다.</p>`};
const statisticsExport=exportRows;
exportRows=function(){if(current!=='STA-01')return statisticsExport();const d=statisticsData(),out=[['구분',kind],['행사',event],['데이터 기준','예시 통계'],['지표','값','단위'],['바이어 수',d.attendance.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0),'명'],['미출석',d.attendance[0],'명'],['출석',d.attendance[1],'명'],['누적 상담 건수',d.count,'건'],['누적 계약 추진 건수',d.contracts,'건']];for(const [enabled,type,values] of [[d.buy,'구매',[320000000,90000000,'KRW']],[d.exp,'수출',[1800000,600000,'USD']]])if(enabled){out.push([type+' 누적 상담액',values[0],values[2]],[type+' 계약 추진액',values[1],values[2]]);const status=dashboardExample[type==='구매'?'buy':'export'].status;out.push([type+' 일지 승인',status[0],'건'],[type+' 일지 대기',status[1],'건'],[type+' 일지 반려',status[2],'건'])}out.push(['참여기업',d.companies[0],'개사'],['불참기업',d.companies[1],'개사'],['참여바이어',d.buyers[0],'명'],['불참바이어',d.buyers[1],'명']);const progress=kind==='구매'?[20,16,14,10]:kind==='수출'?[30,24,22,18]:[50,40,36,28];['검토중','샘플·견적 협의','계약 협의','계약 체결'].forEach((t,i)=>out.push([t,progress[i],'건']));for(const group of [...(d.buy?['국내 바이어']:[]),...(d.exp?['해외 바이어']:[]),'참가기업','품목별']){out.push([],[group+' TOP5',group==='품목별'?statisticsCategory:''],['순위','대상','상담 건수','상담 금액','통화','수출 상담 금액(USD)']);statisticsRanks(group).forEach((r,i)=>out.push([i+1,r.name,r.count,r.amount,r.currency,r.exportAmount||'']))}return out};
